# The jsdom harnesses; see tools/ui-clicks.mjs and tools/page-settled.mjs. The installed
# tree stays out, the manifest does not: ci.yml runs these harnesses, so the version they
# run against has to be the version anyone else gets. Nothing that ships needs npm, which
# is the property that was being protected here and still holds -- this manifest is for
# two development tools and reaches no wheel, no image and no page.
tools/node_modules/
